          "short": "$\\frac{3}{13}$",
          "worked": "Each suit has three picture cards: jack, queen and king. There are $4\\times3=12$ picture cards.\n\n$$P(\\text{picture card})=\\frac{12}{52}=\\frac{3}{13}$$",
